{#- The action system (WS2). EVERY booking control on every v3 page is rendered by `action`, and every
    status word by `statusChip`. Import with context so they read site.json and the shared labels:

      {% from "v3/actions.njk" import action, statusChip with context %}

      {{ action({ slot: "hero", service: "car" }) }}
      {{ action({ slot: "lane", service: "home" }) }}
      {{ action({ slot: "builder", service: "car", build: true }) }}
      {{ statusChip({ form: "long" }) }}        long text "Open now until 5 PM"; default form "short" is "Open"

    action options (one object)
      slot     "hero" | "lane" | "price" | "builder" | "contact" | "bar" | "header" | "drawer"
      service  "car" | "home" | "chip" | "any"      default "any"
      on_book  true on /book itself (book.njk): no Request a time variant anywhere (it would link to the
               page you are on) and no Text variant while site.texts_confirmed is false; a cell with nothing
               to show prints nothing and takes no room. Default false.
      build    true on the builder result: labels read "with this build" and the links take the
               build code when builder.js dispatches the bc:build event (contract in the file
               assets/v3/js/30-actions.js)

    What it prints. Server side it prints the NO-JS state: Call is the primary, Text the secondary
    and the printed hours sit under them, with no status word. Every variant a slot can ever show is
    already in the markup, stacked in one grid cell per role (primary cell, secondary cell), so the
    cell is as wide and as tall as its biggest variant and swapping never moves anything. 30-actions.js
    reads ONE statusAt() result every 60 s and sets data-state / data-primary / data-secondary /
    data-note on each [data-bc-act]; 30-actions.css shows the variant that matches. Hidden variants
    are visibility:hidden, so they are out of the tab order and the accessibility tree.

    Primary by state (blueprint 5.2, decided in assets/v3/js/00-status-core.js plan()):
      open                     Call primary, Text secondary
      closed, holiday          Text primary ONLY IF site.texts_confirmed, else Request a time; the other
                               one is the secondary; a plain "Calls open Tuesday at 9 AM" note
      unknown day              same primary as closed; the note is the printed hours, never "open"
      service home             "Book a free in-home measure" in every state; call (open) or text secondary
      build                    open: Call with this build, secondary Request a time; closed: Text this build
                               if texts are confirmed, else Request a time
      bar                      same primary; when the shop is not open the secondary cell is the plain note
    The header slot is the one exception: its call control stays a tel: link in every state (engineering
    3.2.2), so it carries data-fixed and the script leaves it alone.

    Screen rules the macro's CSS and script enforce (FIXES-A, 2026-10-29):
      phones     the pinned bar is the one gold fill; an in-page generic or chip action drops its primary
                 button (the bar shows the same action), keeping its secondary link and note
                 (30-actions.css); the bar and menu sheet carry the page's one service (?s=) and, on the
                 builder, the build code (30-actions.js)
      768px up   at most one gold fill on screen: extra gold actions get data-quiet and show as the
                 outline, a request form's submit wins (30-actions.js)
      320px      no variant is wider than its line: labels wrap under 480px (WCAG 1.4.10)

    Peak pass R1, part A (2026-10-30):
      texting    while site.texts_confirmed is false (CEO ruling) NO slot prints an sms: link or an
                 "or text" line: not the in-page actions, not the bar, not the menu sheet, not the
                 builder. 30-actions.js swaps a planned Text secondary for Request a time where the
                 slot has one, else for nothing. When the flag is true every Text variant returns.
      open line  hero, lane, contact and builder slots (not home) print pages.book.call_answer
                 ("Someone from the shop answers.") in the note line; 30-actions.css shows it only
                 while the shop is open and Call is the visible primary.
      "or"       a secondary label that starts with "or " carries it in span.v3-or, which phones
                 drop where the primary above it is hidden (no sentence starts with "or"). -#}

{% macro statusChip(opts) -%}
{%- set o = opts or {} -%}
{%- set form = o.form or "short" -%}
<span class="v3-status{% if form == "long" %} v3-status--long{% endif %}" data-bc-status data-form="{{ form }}"><span class="v3-status__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v3-status__txt"></span></span>
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro action(opts) -%}
{%- set o = opts or {} -%}
{%- set sl = o.slot or "lane" -%}
{%- set sv = o.service or "any" -%}
{%- set onBook = o.on_book or false -%}
{%- set showReq = not onBook -%}
{#- CEO ruling (peak R1): no Text anywhere until the shop confirms the line takes texts. With the
    flag true this is the old rule ((not on_book) or texts_confirmed), which is then always true. -#}
{%- set showTxt = site.texts_confirmed === true -%}
{%- set A = pages.shared.v3.actions -%}
{%- set tel = site.phone.tel -%}
{%- set num = site.phone.display_call -%}
{%- if sl == "header" -%}
{%- set H = A.header -%}
<span class="v3-act v3-act--header" data-bc-act data-slot="header" data-service="any" data-fixed="true" data-primary="call"><a class="v3-header__call" data-v="call" data-act="call" href="tel:{{ tel | safe }}" aria-label="{{ H.call_aria | safe }} {{ num | safe }}">{{ H.call | safe }}</a><a class="v3-header__icall" data-v="call" data-act="call" href="tel:{{ tel | safe }}" aria-label="{{ H.call_aria | safe }} {{ num | safe }}"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg></a></span>
{%- else -%}
{%- set kind = "build" if o.build else ("home" if sv == "home" else ("chip" if sv == "chip" else "generic")) -%}
{%- set hours = site.hours | bcHoursLine -%}
{%- set hoursText = A.hours_call | replace("{hours}", hours.short) -%}
{%- set reqHref = "/book" + ("?s=" + sv if sv != "any" else "") -%}
{%- set smsHref = "sms:" + tel -%}
{%- if kind == "chip" %}{% set smsHref = "sms:" + tel + "?&body=" + (A.chip_body | urlencode) %}{% endif -%}
{%- set numHtml = '<span class="tnum">' + num + '</span>' -%}
{%- set photo = site.chip_photo_assess -%}
{#- labels, primary role -#}
{%- set pCall = (A.p_call_build | replace("{number}", numHtml)) if kind == "build" else (A.p_call + " " + numHtml) -%}
{%- if kind == "chip" -%}{%- set pText = A.p_text_chip_photo if photo else A.p_text_chip_plain -%}
{%- elif kind == "build" -%}{%- set pText = A.p_text_build -%}
{%- else -%}{%- set pText = A.p_text + " " + numHtml -%}{%- endif -%}
{#- labels, secondary role -#}
{%- set sCall = A.s_call + " " + numHtml -%}
{%- if kind == "chip" -%}{%- set sText = A.s_text_chip_photo if photo else A.s_text_chip_plain -%}
{%- elif kind == "build" -%}{%- set sText = A.s_text_build -%}
{%- else -%}{%- set sText = A.s_text -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- set sReq = A.s_request | string -%}
{#- a leading "or " rides in its own span so phones can drop it where no button sits above -#}
{%- if sReq.slice(0, 3) == "or " %}{% set sReq = '<span class="v3-or">or </span><span class="v3-or__rest">' + sReq.slice(3) + '</span>' %}{% endif -%}
{%- set sText = sText | string -%}
{%- if sText.slice(0, 3) == "or " %}{% set sText = '<span class="v3-or">or </span><span class="v3-or__rest">' + sText.slice(3) + '</span>' %}{% endif -%}
{%- set gold = (sl == "hero" or sl == "lane" or sl == "contact" or sl == "builder") -%}
{#- "Someone from the shop answers." beside Call, open state only (CSS), never for the home measure -#}
{%- set answer = pages.book.call_answer if (gold and kind != "home" and pages.book and pages.book.call_answer) else "" -%}
{#- no-JS plan: Call primary, Text secondary, hours printed (home: the measure primary, Call secondary).
    Without Text the secondary is Request a time where the slot has one; the bar shows the hours. -#}
{%- set p0 = "measure" if kind == "home" else "call" -%}
{%- if kind == "home" -%}{%- set s0 = "call" -%}
{%- elif showTxt -%}{%- set s0 = "text" -%}
{%- elif sl == "bar" -%}{%- set s0 = "note" -%}
{%- elif showReq -%}{%- set s0 = "request" -%}
{%- else -%}{%- set s0 = "none" -%}{%- endif -%}
<div class="v3-act v3-act--{{ sl }}" data-bc-act data-slot="{{ sl }}" data-service="{{ sv }}" data-kind="{{ kind }}" data-state="nojs" data-primary="{{ p0 }}" data-secondary="{{ s0 }}" data-note="hours"{% if onBook %} data-on-book="true"{% endif %}{% if gold %} data-gold-zone{% endif %}{% if o.build %} data-build="true" data-build-body="{{ A.build_body }}"{% endif %}>
  <div class="v3-act__p">
{%- if kind == "home" %}
    <a class="v3-act__btn" data-v="measure" data-act="measure" href="{{ reqHref }}"><span>{{ A.p_measure | safe }}</span></a>
{%- else %}
    <a class="v3-act__btn" data-v="call" data-act="call" href="tel:{{ tel | safe }}"><span>{{ pCall | safe }}</span></a>
{%- if showTxt %}
    <a class="v3-act__btn" data-v="text" data-act="text" href="{{ smsHref | safe }}"><span>{{ pText | safe }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}
{%- if showReq %}
    <a class="v3-act__btn" data-v="request" data-act="request" href="{{ reqHref }}"><span>{{ A.p_request | safe }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
  </div>
{%- if sl == "bar" %}
  <div class="v3-act__s v3-act__s--bar">
{%- if showTxt %}
    <a class="v3-act__btn v3-act__btn--ghost" data-v="text" data-act="text" href="{{ smsHref | safe }}"><span>{{ A.bar_text | safe }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}
    <span class="v3-act__note" data-v="note-calls"></span>
    <span class="v3-act__note" data-v="note-hours">{{ hoursText | safe }}</span>
  </div>
{%- else %}
  <div class="v3-act__s">
{%- if kind == "home" %}
    <a class="v3-act__link" data-v="call" data-act="call" href="tel:{{ tel | safe }}"><span>{{ sCall | safe }}</span></a>
{%- if showTxt %}
    <a class="v3-act__link" data-v="text" data-act="text" href="{{ smsHref | safe }}"><span>{{ sText | safe }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}
{%- else %}
{%- if showTxt %}
    <a class="v3-act__link" data-v="text" data-act="text" href="{{ smsHref | safe }}"><span>{{ sText | safe }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}
{%- if showReq %}
    <a class="v3-act__link" data-v="request" data-act="request" href="{{ reqHref }}"><span>{{ sReq | safe }}</span></a>
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
  </div>
  <p class="v3-act__n">
    <span class="v3-act__note" data-v="note-calls"></span>
    <span class="v3-act__note" data-v="note-hours">{{ hoursText | safe }}</span>
{%- if answer %}
    <span class="v3-act__note v3-act__note--open" data-v="note-open">{{ answer | safe }}</span>
{%- endif %}
  </p>
{%- endif %}
</div>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}
